{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Inside plang's own goals an \"each goal\" event doesn't run while event.setting.goal is app (the default): Read reads\n%!goal% three times, each read running plang's shortcut goal (/system/shortcut/goal.goal), and \"before each goal\" runs\nCount for Loop and each Read, never for the shortcut goal. With event.setting.goal all, it runs for each shortcut goal\ntoo. Count keeps its count in count.txt beside the test: a shortcut's variables end with its call, a file doesn't.",
